---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy">
  <div class="wrap stack" style="max-width:760px">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="notice">Starter policy. Have it reviewed before launch.</p>
    <p><strong>What we collect.</strong> When you write a review, claim a listing, add a business or contact us about advertising, we collect what you type into the form, such as your name, email and phone.</p>
    <p><strong>How we use it.</strong> To confirm reviews, verify owners, reply to you, and send you messages about your listing. We use HighLevel to send those emails. Reviewer emails are never shown publicly. You can unsubscribe from any email.</p>
    <p><strong>What we don't publish.</strong> We don't publish home addresses, personal phone numbers or personal emails from state records. Phone numbers on listings are business numbers.</p>
    <p><strong>Cookies.</strong> The site works without tracking cookies.</p>
    <p><strong>Requests.</strong> To see, correct or delete what you've sent us, use the contact form on our advertise page.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
